# Co-op map-edge barrier segment: 20 m long, 1 m thick, 20 m tall collider that blocks ONLY the
# player capsules — Layer Barrier collides with Player alone, so wave enemies spawned beyond the
# ring walk straight through (both masks must contain the other's category for a collision). The
# visible piece is a post at the segment center; GameMatch strings pulsing energy lines between
# the posts every frame. Long axis = X; the Game layer rotates the E/W sides 90°. Spawn y = 10
# (collider half height).
Prefab gameBarrier
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Pillar3
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 1 0.5 0.15
		Position 0 -7 0
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Layer Barrier
		CollidesWith Player
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 10 10 0.5
